{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e10-scene-02",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "档案上有我的生日  (My Birthday Is in the Company File)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xiaoye": "小叶",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 10 of Behind the Scenes. Finding a surprise birthday gift waiting for Bu Xiaogu when nobody in the city knows her birthday, Xiaoye and Qin Xiao help her figure out who could have checked her personnel file. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "这是谁送的呀？你不是说你是单身吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我确实是单身，而且这全城也没有人知道我生日。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我从来没有跟别人说过我的生日。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "不会吧，那你是不是忘记什么贵宾了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "公司系统里面有档案，档案上有我的生日。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是人事的系统只有领导能看到，对吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "嗯，还有谁能看到？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "他昨天说到约你喝茶，可能是觉得喝茶太俗了吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那约点别的呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "祝你生日快乐！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "小谷，明天见！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "这是谁送的呀？你不是说你是单身吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who sent this? Didn't you say you were single?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我确实是单身，而且这全城也没有人知道我生日。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I really am single, and nobody in this whole city knows my birthday.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我从来没有跟别人说过我的生日。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have never told anyone when my birthday is.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "不会吧，那你是不是忘记什么贵宾了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No way — could you have forgotten some important person?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "公司系统里面有档案，档案上有我的生日。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The company system has personnel files, and my birthday is on my file.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是人事的系统只有领导能看到，对吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, only senior management can view the personnel system, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "嗯，还有谁能看到？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hmm, who else would be able to see it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "他昨天说到约你喝茶，可能是觉得喝茶太俗了吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yesterday he mentioned inviting you for tea — maybe he felt tea was too ordinary.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那约点别的呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So what if he arranged something else instead?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know who it is!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "祝你生日快乐！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Happy birthday to you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "小谷，明天见！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, see you tomorrow!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "这是谁送的呀？你不是说你是单身吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
